        "cooked": "<p>Matchup #2 - This was a weird game.&nbsp; Atlantis threw out two Phosphorescent Chambers early, then two Krakens - which mostly beat up on the pins.&nbsp; But slowly and steadly we got set up, and slowly and steadily Gloomy's HP went down until he went down for the final count.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>NEXT:&nbsp; Can the Cleansing Downpour team get a win on the Ennead's home turf?</p>",
