        "created_at": "2015-09-20T05:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Matchup #3 - We started out facing Isis, Nepthys, and Set.&nbsp; Two of them were down, and the other was hurt when they pulled out Atum, Nuit, and Shu within three turns of each other.&nbsp; It slowed me down, but the right guys were victorious in the end.&nbsp; This was tougher than it looked, though.&nbsp; Tempest took out pain-in-the-neck Shu with Chain Lightning for the win.</p><p>NEXT:&nbsp; Akash'Bhuta is large and thinks she's in charge.&nbsp; Can we take her down?</p>",
