        "created_at": "2015-09-20T23:51:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Matchup #4&nbsp;- Akash had a couple of crazy turns where she played card after card.&nbsp; But the team had enough to steadily bring her down.</p><p>NEXT:&nbsp; The team goes up against Apostate.</p>",
