      {
        "id": 131460,
        "name": "Honolulu Blue",
        "username": "Honolulu_Blue",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/ecae2f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-21T23:40:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Matchup #6 - Aesop was right - plodding does win the race.&nbsp; Slowly and steadily that big old zombie's went down.&nbsp; When Gloomy flipped, he attacked everyone right on schedule, but thanks to some Explosives Wagons, Wraith didn't last long after that.&nbsp; Tempest went down a few turns later.&nbsp; Only Legacy, with most of his defensive cards, was able to survive.&nbsp; Tempest was able to get him to use his Back-Fist strike to get rid of Gloomy's last few hit points.&nbsp; Victory was ours!!!</p><p>Thanks, everyone, for stopping by.</p>",
